  (4)-[Option]: Demonic God (Shinjin) [1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Action to use the Basic Attack Maneuver, Signature Technique Maneuver, or a Unique Ability with an Action Cost of 1 Action as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

